ppropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn6le07ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Present Perfect and the Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "1. We use the Present Perfect for actions which started in the past and are still happening now OR for finished actions which have a connection to the present.<br>2. We use the Simple Past for past events or actions which have no connection to the present.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Rule\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Explanation\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You use the <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Perfect</span> when the time period has NOT finished.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I've been having problems with my internet connection.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" The time period goes up to the present.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You use the <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Past</span> when the time period HAS finished.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I found this cozy little cafe last night when I was out for my nightly walk.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Last night has finished.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Future Actions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use four different tenses to talk about the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ul><li>When you talk about things that are not decided or when you make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future, you use the modal <span class = \"italic\">will</span>.</li><br>  <li>When you ask about intentions, you use<span class = \"italic\"> going to</span>.</li><br>  <li>When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future, you use the<span class = \"italic\"> Present Continuous tense</span>.</li><br>  <li>When you talk about schedules or timetables in the future, you use the <span class = \"italic\">Simple Present tense</span>.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Verb Tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" After that, I will grab a quick shower.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Going to</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I'm going to get some groceries this afternoon.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Present Continuous </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" The appointment is at 4:00.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" The dinner is at 7 tonight.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "consistently ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do the same thing all the ti