"id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn6le07ob11re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: Hello Tracy? What's up?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Tracy</span>:  Hey Peter! I'm quickly eating breakfast. I'm going to get some groceries later on.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: Well, feel like grabbing a coffee later tonight? I've discovered a cozy little cafe on my street. I thought we should check it out.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Tracy</span>: Sounds alluring! Have you seen inside?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn6le07ob11re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: Yes, it looks really cool.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Tracy</span>: What are you doing now?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: I'm reading the paper like I consistently do every morning, then after that I will grab a quick shower. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Tracy</span>: It's like you're superstitious, the same morning routine everyday!", "id": 2, "time": "20400", "image": "engenn6le07ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: Funny you say that. I always read the paper and have my morning coffee in the exactly same way every day. Later today, I have to fix something on my computer. I'm taking my laptop into a repair shop this afternoon.  The appointment is at 4:00.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Tracy</span>: What's wrong?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Peter</span>: I'm not sure. I've been having problems with my internet connection. I need someone to help me figure it out. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\"> Tracy</span>: Well it won't be me! Good luck with that!", "id": 3, "time": "33500", "image": "engenn6le07ob11re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le07ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le07ob11re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}